                          refId="Package\Extract\منابع انسانی\سرانه آموزش\G1733_سرانه آموزش ستاد_HCMKPI\G1733_HCMKPI1"
                          componentClassID="Microsoft.OLEDBSource"
                          contactInfo="OLE DB Source;Microsoft Corporation; Microsoft SQL Server; (C) Microsoft Corporation; All Rights Reserved; http://www.microsoft.com/sql/support;7"
                          description="OLE DB Source"
                          name="G1733_HCMKPI1"
                          usesDispositions="true"
                          version="7">
                          <properties>
                            <property
                              dataType="System.Int32"
                              description="The number of seconds before a command times out.  A value of 0 indicates an infinite time-out."
                              name="CommandTimeout">0</property>
                            <property
                              dataType="System.String"
                              description="Specifies the name of the database object used to open a rowset."
                              name="OpenRowset"></property>
                            <property
                              dataType="System.String"
                              description="Specifies the variable that contains the name of the database object used to open a rowset."
                              name="OpenRowsetVariable"></property>
                            <property
                              dataType="System.String"
                              description="The SQL command to be executed."
                              name="SqlCommand"
                              UITypeEditor="Microsoft.DataTransformationServices.Controls.ModalMultilineStringEditor, Microsoft.DataTransformationServices.Controls, Version=16.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=89845dcd8080cc91">;with cte1 as
(
 select k1.PersianDateStr1, k1.PersianDateStr2,k1.PersonnelId, k1.Duration, k1.ravesh_code, k1.Course_code, k1.kind_code, k1.NationalCode , k1.IsActive
 ,iif(ravesh_code=4, duration/2.0,duration) as duration1
 , (1+cast(Replace(left(PersianDatestr2,7),'/','') as int) -cast(Replace(left(PersianDatestr1,7),'/','') as int) ) as countmonth
 , k1.classid
 from OKDWH_STG.Extract.hcmkpi1 k1
 
 where kind_code in (1006 , 1007)
  and k1.IsActive=1
 
 )
 , cte2 as
 (
 select distinct cte1.classid,m.countofperson* duration1 as nafarsaat
  from cte1
 inner join (select classid,count(distinct NationalCode) countofperson from cte1
 group by classid
 ) M on m.classid=cte1.classid
 )


 ,cte3 as 
  (select sum( 1.0*nafarsaat) as sumDuration, (select count(distinct c.PersonnelId) from Extract.HCMCommandment c 
    inner join OKDWH.HRM.DIM_Department dep on dep.id=c.depid
  where 
   dep.DepTypeSN=1
 and (Isnull(c.EndDate/100, 149901)&lt;&gt;?)
)  CountPerson
  from cte2
 )

 select (sumDuration/CountPerson) as final from cte3</property>
