                                  description="The mappings between the parameters in the SQL command and variables."
                                  name="ParameterMapping">"Parameter0:Input",{F019B1D3-FD97-4040-AA55-BB49190ECA3E};"Parameter1:Input",{F019B1D3-FD97-4040-AA55-BB49190ECA3E};"Parameter2:Input",{F019B1D3-FD97-4040-AA55-BB49190ECA3E};"Parameter3:Input",{F019B1D3-FD97-4040-AA55-BB49190ECA3E};</property>
